cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GTS, please cite it as below."
title: "GTS — Graph Transport Substrate"
abstract: >-
  GTS v2 carries RDF datasets and content-addressed binary attachments in an appendable
  sequence of CBOR items. The specification defines content identity, reader results,
  recovery, signatures and sealing. This software release predates v2 and provides six interoperable engines
  (Rust, Python, Go, TypeScript, Smalltalk/Pharo, and Kotlin/JVM) for the earlier format.

